OL,3,GNEWSATurkey and tinsel trips boost     
OL,4,Aseaside economies                      
OL,6,FCoach trippers visiting the South West 
OL,7,Fto stay in hotels for Christmas themed 
OL,8,Fbreaks in November and December        
OL,9,Fcontribute millions to the local       
OL,10,Feconomy.                               
OL,12,FSo-called tinsel and turkey holidays   
OL,13,Fhave been running for decades, bringing
OL,14,Fmuch needed income to the hospitality  
OL,15,Fsector at what can be a quiet time of  
OL,16,Fyear.                                  
OL,18,FThe English Riviera Bid company says   
OL,19,Fduring November and December, 400,000  
OL,20,Fpeople stay in Torbay contributing #30m
OL,21,Fto the local economy.                  
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
