OL,3,GNEWSATurkey and tinsel trips boost     
OL,4,Aseaside economies                      
OL,6,FThe Caledonian Torbay Hotel in         
OL,7,FTorquay's hotel manager Pedro Anzules  
OL,8,Fsaid: "I've been doing this myself for 
OL,9,Fover 25 years and it has always been   
OL,10,Freally attractive. It's still a thing, 
OL,11,Fit's just amazing."                    
